{"title":"Career roadmap · Interpreter","role":"Interpreter","summary":"An Interpreter facilitates real-time or near-real-time communication between people who speak different languages. Depending on specialisation, interpreters work in business, diplomacy, healthcare, legal settings, conferences, tourism, media, technology, international organisations and localisation.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Translation & Interpretation (German / French / Japanese / Korean / Chinese / Arabic)"},"about":[{"label":"Alignment","text":"Strong direct alignment"},{"label":"Interpretation is different from written translation","text":"interpreters need high listening comprehension, rapid processing, accurate speech, cultural awareness and excellent command of both languages."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Interpreter facilitates real-time or near-real-time communication between people who speak different languages. Depending on specialisation, interpreters work in business, diplomacy, healthcare, legal settings, conferences, tourism, media, technology, international organisations and localisation."}]},{"heading":"Typical route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["BA Translation & Interpretation","Language Proficiency Development","Interpretation Internship/Practice","Language Assistant / Junior Interpreter","Interpreter","Conference/Technical Interpreter","Senior Interpreter","Interpretation Lead / Language Services Manager"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Achieve high proficiency in the selected foreign language and develop consecutive/simultaneous interpretation skills."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Specialise in business, diplomacy, healthcare, legal, technical, conference or media interpretation."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Handle complex assignments, specialised terminology and high-level conferences."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Progress toward Senior Interpreter, Conference Interpreter, Language Services Manager, Interpretation Consultant or independent specialist."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Language foundation"},{"text":"Grammar, vocabulary, pronunciation"},{"text":"Language proficiency assessment"},{"text":"Language skill"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Listening & speaking"},{"text":"Conversation, media"},{"text":"Recorded speaking portfolio"},{"text":"Communication"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Consecutive interpretation"},{"text":"Note-taking, memory"},{"text":"20 interpretation recordings"},{"text":"Processing speed"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"Translation fundamentals"},{"text":"Translation theory, terminology"},{"text":"Translation portfolio"},{"text":"Accuracy"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Advanced interpretation"},{"text":"Consecutive/simultaneous practice"},{"text":"Mock conference"},{"text":"Professional skill"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Interpretation internship"},{"text":"Conference/business/media setting"},{"text":"Internship + interpretation credits"},{"text":"Employability"}],[{"text":"Honours Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Domain specialisation"},{"text":"Legal/medical/diplomatic/business vocabulary"},{"text":"Specialised glossary"},{"text":"Domain expertise"}],[{"text":"Honours Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Professional launch"},{"text":"Advanced practice + dissertation"},{"text":"Interpretation reel + portfolio"},{"text":"Career readiness"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Core subjects to prioritise"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Foreign Language"},{"text":"Advanced Grammar"},{"text":"Phonetics & Pronunciation"},{"text":"Listening C